          "text": "$$\\ln|y| = x^2 + C_1 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad y = Ce^{x^2}$$"
        },
        {
          "title": "ЗК: y(0)=1",
          "text": "$1 = Ce^0 = C$ → $C = 1$.",
          "math": "$$\\boxed{y = e^{x^2}}$$"
        }
      ]
    },
